Feature: Site Landing Pages
	API testing for checking site landing pages

Setup:
	* I get all site URLs

Scenario: Okta Site
    @ help.center.smoke = "true"
    Okta Site should be up and running.

    Given I should be able to view the "${oktaURL}" page

